[We can reject the null in favor of the alternative that the number of students is not the same across majors.]{.fragment}
:::

::: {.column .fragment width="30%"}

::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
obs_chisq <- (51 - 40)^2 / 40 +
  (33 - 40)^2 / 40 +
  (32 - 40)^2 / 40 +
  (32 - 40)^2 / 40 +
  (52 - 40)^2 / 40
obs_chisq
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
[1] 11.05
```


:::

```{.r .cell-code}
obs_chisq > chisq_crit
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
[1] TRUE
```


:::

```{.r .cell-code}
pchisq(obs_chisq, df = df)
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
[1] 0.9739922
```


:::

```{.r .cell-code}
1 - pchisq(obs_chisq, df = df) # test p-value
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
[1] 0.02600779
```


:::
:::

